     1,
     "If the plot is &#39;p&#39;, then you can change the labels arbitrarily like this:\r<br>\r<br>p + scale_x_continuous(labels=c(&quot;a&quot;,&quot;b&quot;,&quot;c&quot;,&quot;d&quot;,&quot;e&quot;))\r<br>\r<br>See ?scale_x_continuous for more information.\r<br>\r<br>Ben\r<br>"
    ],
